    "flat-components-too-few":"The detector found too few dark value components.",
    "flat-value-rows-too-few":"The detector found fewer than the required accepted value rows.",
    "flat-row-run-too-small":"The accepted value rows did not form a repeated run.",
    "flat-number-tracks-too-few":"The detector found rows, but not enough repeated number tracks.",
    "flat-template-not-enough-tracks":"The detector found too few column tracks for the template.",
    "flat-template-fit-failed":"The column tracks did not fit the template.",
    "flat-template-columns-incomplete":"The template fit did not produce every expected column."
